# Cloudflare Pages Redirects
# Redirect deleted fountain (çeşme) pages to main Eserler page
# This prevents 404 errors and preserves SEO value

# Pattern: redirect all çeşme pages to /eserler/
/eserler/*-cesme-*     /eserler/   301
/eserler/*-çeşme-*     /eserler/   301
/eserler/*-cesmesi-*   /eserler/   301
/eserler/*-çeşmesi-*   /eserler/   301

